benchmarks/data/agentharm/
# Trajectory corpora: 1.1GB of externally-authored HF datasets plus a vendored agentdojo
# clone. Re-fetched by training/trajectory/code/, never committed. One parquet here is
# 151MB, past GitHub's 100MB hard limit, so `git add -A` without this rule builds a commit
# the push rejects outright.
benchmarks/data/trajectories/
benchmarks/data/injecagent/test_cases_*.json
benchmarks/results/qwen_scores/eval_cache.jsonl
benchmarks/results/**/*.log
downloads/
runs/
