# External / third-party tooling workspaces — ONE ROOF, LOCAL ONLY, never tracked.
# Vendor pilots, their benchmark caches, optimizer state, feedback drafts. Anything
# that belongs to someone else's tool goes here and stays out of the repo.
# Findings worth keeping are promoted into the tracked docs instead.
.external/

